WLDAP GDB Server
================

This repository is a fork of cmsis_dap_tcp_esp32 by Brian Kuschak
(https://github.com/bkuschak/cmsis_dap_tcp_esp32), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

That upstream project in turn contains CMSIS-DAP firmware code from ARM Limited
(https://github.com/ARM-software/CMSIS-DAP) and Espressif Systems sources.
Original copyright notices and SPDX headers are retained in every source file.

Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

Added:
  sdkconfig.board_esp32c5_mini   ESP32-C5-MINI board configuration
  host/openocd-wldap.cfg         OpenOCD CMSIS-DAP-over-TCP configuration
  host/README.md                 host-side wiring and usage notes
  scripts/build_wldap.sh         build wrapper for the C5 preset
  scripts/flash_wldap.sh         flash + monitor wrapper
  .vscode/launch.json            debug configuration for the C5 built-in USB-JTAG
  .vscode/settings.json          build path / OpenOCD board / clangd settings
  .clangd                        clangd compile-flag adjustments

Modified:
  CMakePresets.json              added the board_esp32c5_mini configure preset
  README.md                      replaced with a WLDAP-specific description of
                                 this fork and its relationship to upstream

No source file under main/ was modified. Protocol handling, SWD bit-banging,
WiFi, and UART bridge code remain as received from upstream.

The ESP32-C5 target support is implemented entirely through Kconfig values in
sdkconfig.board_esp32c5_mini, which is the board-support mechanism used by
upstream.

